Changes: selected the artist's diffuse Gupta and Vakataka core curves, sampled them into polygons, approximately georegistered them using city markers, and added dated context metadata and diffuse rendering. The map is schematic and does not establish exact frontiers. The source SVG is retained in references/gupta-map-sources/.
